      <message name="IDS_FORK_VPN_ERROR_HEADING" desc="Interface of the fork.">The VPN server doesn't answer</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_VPN_ERROR_SUMMARY" desc="Interface of the fork.">So as not to show the IP of your home to sites, the browser doesn't switch to the direct connection by itself.</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_VPN_DIRECT_BUTTON" desc="Interface of the fork.">Browse directly (reserve)</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_INVIDIOUS_ERROR_HEADING" desc="Interface of the fork.">Your Invidious doesn't answer</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_INVIDIOUS_ERROR_SUMMARY" desc="Interface of the fork.">The browser tried the home address and the Tailscale one. YouTube doesn't open by itself: open it yourself if you want.</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_OPEN_ON_YOUTUBE" desc="Interface of the fork.">Open on YouTube</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_DIRECT_BAR_TITLE" desc="Interface of the fork.">Direct connection.</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_DIRECT_BAR_TEXT" desc="Interface of the fork.">Sites see the IP of your home.</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_DIRECT_CONFIRM_TITLE" desc="Interface of the fork.">Browse without the VPN?</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_DIRECT_CONFIRM_BODY" desc="Interface of the fork.">Sites will see the IP of your home. Direct mode ends when the browser closes or after 24 hours, and goes back to the VPN by itself when the server answers.</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_DIRECT_CONFIRM_OK" desc="Interface of the fork.">Browse directly</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_VPN_BACK_NOTICE" desc="Interface of the fork.">The VPN server answers again: the browser went back to going out through the VPN.</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_VPN_OFF" desc="Interface of the fork.">VPN off</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_VPN_OFF_TIP" desc="Interface of the fork.">VPN off: you go out through the normal connection.</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_VPN_ON_TIP" desc="Interface of the fork.">You go out through the VPN of your server.</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_VPN_DOWN" desc="Interface of the fork.">VPN unreachable</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_VPN_DOWN_TIP" desc="Interface of the fork.">The VPN server doesn't answer: no page goes out directly.</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_VPN_DIRECT" desc="Interface of the fork.">Direct · IP visible</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_VPN_DIRECT_TIP" desc="Interface of the fork.">Direct connection: sites see the IP of your home.</message>
