      <message name="IDS_FORK_CLAUDE_PAGE_DESC" desc="Interface of the fork.">Chats and tasks on the page: Claude in Chrome with your claude.ai subscription.</message>
      <message name="IDS_FORK_CLAUDE_CHATS_DESC" desc="Interface of the fork.">claude.ai with your account: chats, projects and artifacts, as in the app.</message>
